OL,3,GNEWSADecorated soldier takes on South  
OL,4,APole trek                              
OL,6,FA highly decorated bomb disposal expert
OL,7,Fis preparing to take on an epic South  
OL,8,FPole challenge to raise money for      
OL,9,Fveterans' mental health.               
OL,11,FMaj James Wadsworth MBE, from Aldershot
OL,12,Fin Hampshire, is planning to climb     
OL,13,FAntarctica's highest mountain, Mount   
OL,14,FVinson, which stands at 16,050ft       
OL,15,F(4,892m), before skiing 60 nautical    
OL,16,Fmiles (111km) to the South Pole.       
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
