OL,3,GNEWSADecorated soldier takes on South  
OL,4,APole trek                              
OL,6,FThe British Army bomb disposal expert, 
OL,7,Fwas awarded the Conspicuous Gallantry  
OL,8,FCross in 2008, the UK's second-highest 
OL,9,Fmilitary decoration, after safely      
OL,10,Frendering one of the largest bombs     
OL,11,Fdiscovered during the Iraq conflict.   
OL,13,FHe is hoping to begin his trek on      
OL,14,FWednesday, raising money for Combat    
OL,15,FStress charity.                        
